<!--
  App launcher foreground: a photo frame + download arrow (spec §38).
  Drawn inside the adaptive-icon safe zone (central ~66/108 of the 108 viewport).
  - White rounded rectangle = image/photo frame
  - A small mountain inside = image glyph
  - Blue download arrow at the bottom = download action
-->
